    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. \"statistically significant trend\" sounds good. but i'm worried if they see 0.06 they're gonna get hung up on it and say the results aren't conclusive. could we actually just describe the findings as \"statistically significant\" in the summary slide? i mean, it's so close to 0.05, does it really matter that much for a pitch?",
